                        TranSend - Product Overview
			---------------------------

TransSend is a development toolkit that allows rapid construction of
real-time client/server and distributed applications. TransSend is the
perfect foundation for all of your network development needs, including:

     o Real-time client/server and distributed applications

     o High performance data distribution systems

     o Cross-platform connectivity

     o Fault-tolerant systems


TransSend Delivers:
- -------------------

     o High performance bidirectional client/server messaging and
       RPCs.

     o Point-to-point and broadcast data distribution

     o Immediate notification of network events for real-time and
       fault-tolerant systems

     o The highest possible throughput over a LAN or WAN

     o A publish and subscribe interface to effortlessly distribute
       data

     o Pre-built utilities that give any TransSend application remote
       control and query capabilities

     o A powerful event mechanism available to any component of your
       application or library

Let TransSend's enabling technology provide you with the most robust
networking solution!


TransSend is the Obvious Choice
- -------------------------------

     o TransSend is fully contained within your application, library,
       or object. Your customers need not concern themselves with extra
       processes or configuration files.

     o Innovative technology all of your client connections to be multiplexed
       through a single socket.

     o High client/server ratios combined with low resource utilization
       allow your customers to do more with less hardware.

     o TransSend uses only the most reliable system resources: sockets
       and virtual memory. Kernel modifications are never required.

     o See inside your application with TransSend's powerful debugging
       tools.

     o One line of code integrates TranSend with X-windows

     o TransSend is easy to learn and includes several immediately
       useful examples.

Provide your customers the high performance solutions they deserve, while
concentrating your valuable time developing your product!


