-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----

'ispcost' is a program that keeps track of your on-line time and costs. When you
press the 'Connect' button, 'dial' will start the PPP daemon, wait until the
link is up and then show a running total of time and money used.

Each call is logged noting beginning and ending time as well as cost. Calls that
do not succeed are also logged.

Totals by month and year are also calculated.

New features in this release:
- - No longer uses the libsx library.
- - Shows cost and time even when iconified.

Other features:
- - Automatic redialing if line is busy.
- - Automatically loads PPP modules if required.
- - Automatically takes holidays such as Christmas and Easter-related holidays
  into account.
