can subscribe by sending the following line in the body of a message
to majordomo@vger.rutgers.edu:

    subscribe linux-kernel-digest

You can get help on the majordomo mailing list manager by sending the
following line in the body of a message to majordomo@vger.rutgers.edu:

    help

On the issue of contact addresses, if you have problems with a
particular vger mailing list, please first attempt to contact the
list's maintainer. The maintainer of a particular vger list can be
found as owner-<listname>@vger.rutgers.edu. Replace <listname> with
the name of the particular list.

If you still have problems, please send mail to
vger-lists@vger.rutgers.edu which reaches David Miller and myself.

If your "problem" is the relative slowness of vger as compared to
other machines when handling subscriptions, please take into account
that vger is extremely SLOW. Delays of several hours are common. :)

Tom Dyas
owner-linux-kernel@vger.rutgers.edu


