Hello,

I would like to announce another release of a graphical interface to the
cool ray-tracer POV-Ray called xfpovray.  It requires the XForms library,
and supports most of the numerous options of POV-Ray.  Since I did not get
any reports of any serious errors, the current version
is v1.0.  Changes since v0.9:

1. Added an "Abort Render" function; allows interrupt at any time
   during render.
